  <item nodeId="node-1">
    <command xml:space="preserve">Why don't you dance</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Why don't you dance&#x000A;An Interactive Fiction by Ray&#x000A;Release 1 / Serial number 250110 / Inform 7 v10.1.2 / D&#x000A;&#x000A;Kitchen&#x000A;You are standing in the small and  kitchen, try to pour yourself another drink while your hands are shivering. &#x000A;&#x000A;Is it because the pain or is it just a kind of performance?  They say you can only show your real self when acting like another one - now this new role is a middle-aged divorced man who is living in a crumbling house, trying to sell some old furniture. &#x000A;&#x000A;You splash some of the wine. That doesn't matter. &#x000A;&#x000A;You look out of the kitchen window with blurry eyes, the bedroom suite in the front yard shows up. Just wait. Wait for as long as it can. Wait for nothing, wait for a coming end.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can see a desk (on which are a bottle of whisky and a glass) and Ray here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
