    <result xml:space="preserve">Kitchen&#x000A;You are standing in the small and  kitchen, try to pour yourself another drink while your hands are shivering. You are trying to sell some old furniture. &#x000A;&#x000A;Some of the wine is still remaining on the floor. &#x000A;&#x000A;You look out of the kitchen window with blurry eyes, the bedroom suite in the front yard shows up. Just wait. Wait for as long as it can. Wait for nothing, wait for a coming end.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can see a desk (on which are a bottle of whisky and a glass) and Ray here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
