  <item nodeId="node-38">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look at the window</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">In the front yard, the mattress was stripped and the candy-striped sheets lay beside two pillows on the chiffonier. Except for that, things looked much the way they had in the bedroom - nightstand and reading lamp on his side of the bed, nightstand and reading lamp on her side.&#x000A;&#x000A;Her side, her side.&#x000A;&#x000A;look at the whisky in glass, like an amber. Time seems to be a illusion, or a trap. Blood runs in fingers. When will it end?&#x000A;&#x000A;Why don't you have another drink? &#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-39"/>
    </children>
  </item>
