  <item nodeId="node-55">
    <command xml:space="preserve">y</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Why don't you dance&#x000A;An Interactive Fiction by Ray&#x000A;Release 1 / Serial number 240130 / Inform 7 v10.1.2 / D&#x000A;&#x000A;Kitchen&#x000A;You are standing in the kitchen, try to pour yourself another drink while your hands are shivering.&#x000A;&#x000A; Is it because the pain or is it just a kind of performance?  They say you can only show your real self when acting like another one - now this new role is a middle-aged divorced man who is living in a crumbling house, trying to sell some old furniture.&#x000A;&#x000A;You splash some of the wine. That doesn't matter.&#x000A;&#x000A;You looked out of the kitchen window with blurry eyes, the bedroom suite in the front yard shows up.&#x000A;&#x000A;Just wait . Wait for as long as it can. Wait for nothing, for a coming end.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can see a window and a desk (on which are a bottle of wine and a glass) here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-56"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-56">
    <command xml:space="preserve">take all</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">window: Taken.&#x000A;bottle of wine: Taken.&#x000A;glass: Taken.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-57">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">(the desk)&#x000A;On the desk are a bottle of whisky and a glass.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-58"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-58">
    <command xml:space="preserve">look </command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Kitchen&#x000A;You are standing in the kitchen, try to pour yourself another drink while your hands are shivering.&#x000A;&#x000A; Is it because the pain or is it just a kind of performance?  They say you can only show your real self when acting like another one - now this new role is a middle-aged divorced man who is living in a crumbling house, trying to sell some old furniture.&#x000A;&#x000A;You splash some of the wine. That doesn't matter.&#x000A;&#x000A;You look out of the kitchen window with blurry eyes, the bedroom suite in the front yard shows up.&#x000A;&#x000A;Just wait . Wait for as long as it can. Wait for nothing, wait for a coming end.&#x000A;&#x000A;You can see a desk (on which are a bottle of whisky and a glass) here.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-59">
    <command xml:space="preserve">x me</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Everything around you isn't real, and you don't know what else to do except waiting. You are a total faliure.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-60"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-60">
    <command xml:space="preserve">z</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">Time passes. the air flows, the world is like a stream. It makes you fell like that you can see the smallest thing.&#x000A;&#x000A;You hear something.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-61"/>
    </children>
  </item>
  <item nodeId="node-61">
    <command xml:space="preserve">listen</command>
    <result xml:space="preserve">You hear the summer breeze, though now is late autumn. Winter is coming.&#x000A;&#x000A;&gt;</result>
    <commentary xml:space="preserve"></commentary>
    <changed>NO</changed>
    <children>
      <child nodeId="node-62"/>
    </children>
  </item>
